    ('A38',
     "Livy and Mike were earnestly all about making sure we were tended to and felt cared for. I've never had a more responsive host. The treehouse is exceptionally peaceful and listening to the brook below us was a gift. We opted for the Forest Tableau, Stargazing, and Morning Moments. All the food was very good, a lot of it homemade, and abundant! It's not a flat hike to the treetop abode so put on some good shoes and prepare to get winded when you go back up. HA! But it was worth it and a once in a lifetime experience.",
     'Nancy · Mount Pleasant, SC', 'May 2025'),
