     'My wife and I had a wonderful time at this hidden gem! Probably one of the most unique places I’ve ever stayed. The design and engineering are super impressive and it’s very comfortable.\n\nMike and Livy are thoughtful and proactive, and did everything in their power to make sure we had a great stay. They also gave some delicious dough for a pizza night!\n\nCan’t wait to return, highly recommend!',
